# API Routes

- Use route handlers in `/app/api/*`
- Validate **all** input using Zod
- Return a consistent JSON structure:

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD
return NextResponse.json({ success: true, data: result });
return NextResponse.json({ success: false, error: "Validation failed" }, { status: 400 });

// ❌ BAD
return NextResponse.json(result);
return NextResponse.json({ message: "error" });
```

# Performance

- Never process bulk jobs inside an API request directly
- Offload heavy tasks (PDF generation) to async flows
- Avoid blocking loops in API routes
